    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cb4172ead5fc37925258c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 14:36:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请到了 @槲寄生 老师参与此次录制，非常非常感谢槲老师带来的选题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容导览：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> intro ：洞穴奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 第一轮各自发言</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都处在“相对剥夺”的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> &nbsp;快乐与幸福之争</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢玩手机就是快乐的猪嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> 那要不要走出洞穴？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候拒绝选项意味着丧失更多可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“我没的选”</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果人生终将痛苦，我们应该如何面对？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2263">37:43</a> &nbsp;也许，我是说也许</span></p><span></span><p><span>别自欺欺人了，也许只是俗世当中的一只痛苦的猪🐷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 完美的寄语环节</span></p>]]></description>
