  <item>
    <title>vol.010 选了连续多年被稳定评为“红牌专业”的心理学，4年后的我们后悔了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a904ff33ddcbb53c31b4d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a904ff33ddcbb53c31b4d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 15:21:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>永远都跟不上热点的栏目组，不出意外地，又在志愿填报完后的好久好久（其实也才一个月）出了志愿选择的主题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实，也不觉得自己有给出别人建议的权利啦，就是想和大家聊聊，选了连续多年被稳定评为“红牌专业”的心理学，4年后的我们后悔了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容导览：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 选了心理学红牌专业，我后悔了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> &nbsp;我喜欢的vs爸妈觉得好就业的</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“选个志愿也要舌战群儒‘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 专业不好就业啥的，原来是个伪命题呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“从事专业对口工作的人群比例不到25%”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 理性权衡下的决策，一定是“好”的决策吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“一个强烈的念头对人的影响是非常大的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> &nbsp;什么能称为“后悔”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“人在任何情况下都拥有选择的权利”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 过度拆解会陷入虚无主义</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“而spark存在于每个想要活着的瞬间”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvcZ2_RUPwQbjeEFXvBeT30j4AZ7.m4a" length="18804163" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvI4L_x1-Nhb6e3sA1S3k560QBIm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.009 我！不要！再做个！&quot;好学生&quot;了！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66816acb077b88831b442eaf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66816acb077b88831b442eaf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 14:25:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>地铁撞了人自我谴责八百遍，体检被插队忍气吞声排后面</span></p><span></span><p><span>从小被教育要无私奉献，可是我真的讨厌被放在道德制高点</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天这期播客，聊聊长久以来“好学生”的执念如何影响我们的情绪表达。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容导览：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 撞了你很抱歉，我只想快点过安检</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> "正反馈"不断塑造我们成为一个"好学生"</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"大学生，素质高，任人揉捏小面包"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 客服沟通vs理发店</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;合理控制和表达情绪的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 不合理表达情绪又怎样呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Manner 事件，我站店员"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 头脑特工队2</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I am a great/bad/ selfish... person</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a> 善 恶 自 有 来 处</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;但行好事，莫问前程。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3016">50:16</a> 校车争执事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;谁痛苦，谁改变，解决眼下自身课题。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvebjDrtjGA6h4kGtXlDZ-fuWeaW.m4a" length="62236341" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTfFMwzfR2OifHzcwCOSwIQFaOT.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.008 如果另一个人以你感受不到的方式爱你，这算爱吗?还是说我们应该接受这部分损失?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6651c64d4efbc0c3dcf9a51c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6651c64d4efbc0c3dcf9a51c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 May 2024 11:06:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们邀请到了提出这个问题的 @小羊 同学共同录制了本次播客~</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾介绍：@小羊：</span><em><span>工科转心理学并跨保心理所的狠人、被两个疑似npd接连创到</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>常驻主播</span><em><span>（对，还是我们四个）</span></em><span>：@冬白 @陆路 @泰账房 @雾雾树</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>内容导览：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 感受不到？算爱吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;爱的花样形式和爱的个人需求</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 差异的确存在，如何减少遗憾？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span>3次机会 &nbsp;愿意沟通的心</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 关系类型与我们的磨合意愿度</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;东亚亲子 &nbsp;朋友 恋人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 人际关系像一场股市，你对每支股票有什么样的期待？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span>及时止损？还是望长放短？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">1:01:13</a> 彩蛋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;@小羊 谈"抽离"的能力</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>地球online，玩得愉快~</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
